<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups Midwest Express.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups Midwest Express.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Goldman Sachs analyst Glenn Engel upgraded air carrier Midwest Express to trading buy from market outperform on the prospect of increased earnings.</p>
<p>- &quot;Midwest Express has always had a great service image,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>- Engel increased projections for yearly earnings this year to $3.20 a share from $2.95, and to $3.60 from $3.30 in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) - 859-1730</p>
</text>
